{"availability":"available","full":"tornikepe/bazari","name":"bazari","description":"🛒 Bilingual (ka/en) e-commerce storefront — faceted catalog filtering, cart & checkout, wishlist, order tracking, and a full admin panel with product/category CRUD and order management. Next.js 16, PostgreSQL + Prisma 7, Tailwind v4. Live demo, no real payments.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-25T14:51:45Z","updated":"2026-10-12T10:25:06Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bazari-tornikepes-projects.vercel.app","topics":["ecommerce","georgia","i18n","nextjs","postgresql","prisma","react","server-actions","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://bazari-tornikepes-projects.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.306Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.306Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.306Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:43.729Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:00.306Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A bilingual Georgian online shop: storefront, checkout, payments, and a staff dashboard that runs the whole business from one place.","ქართული · English · Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · PostgreSQL + Prisma 7 · Tailwind CSS v4","The shop is called Luto. The repository, the Vercel project and the deployment URL still say bazari, which is what it was called while it was being built — renaming those breaks links and buys nothing. The name on screen is a row in the database (ShopSettings.name) and nothing in this codebase hardcodes it, so changing it in Dashboard → Settings changes it everywhere: the bar, the tab, the footer, the share cards, the structured data, the dashboard rail and the signature on every email the shop sends."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tornikepe/bazari/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0e1b2b70e369fa4bc7835e8053ca107a2420504414b330ef9346